  "monthComparisonInsufficientTitle": "Not enough history yet",
  "@monthComparisonInsufficientTitle": {"description": "AC-E4.2 — with fewer than two months of data there is no honest comparison to draw. The arithmetic would still work (this month vs nothing = up 100%), and every number in it would be correct while the conclusion was nonsense."},
