  "filterAmountCurrencyNote": "Compared in {currency}, using the rate each transaction recorded.",
  "@filterAmountCurrencyNote": {
    "description": "NFR-A5 — an amount range typed into a form is in ONE currency while a ledger can hold several, so the screen states which one and where the rate came from rather than silently comparing 20.00 against 20.00 USD.",
